id: pm-review-deadline-esrch
title: Treat vanished deadline descendants as terminated
description: "Handle ENOENT and ESRCH consistently across process enumeration, liveness reads and deadline signals, while preserving live-process and unrelated-error failures."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[1]: "gh:unbraind/pm-review#56"
created_at: "2026-10-28T19:28:53.537Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-28T19:41:19.947Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: "Deterministic disappearance schedules cover enumeration, stat and signal boundaries and fail on source revert; Live descendants remain blocking and unrelated failures are visible; Focused tests, typecheck and lint pass and npm/Bun CI release gates certify the final head"
resolution: "Share ENOENT/ESRCH classification across process enumeration, liveness and group/PID signalling; retain PID fallback and return bounded cleanup refusals for unrelated failures."
actual_result: Focused linked tests pass 35/35 with zero failures or skips; deterministic source reverts fail and restoration passes. Final-head npm/Bun release gates are delegated to PR CI.
comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-28T19:29:02.870Z",codex-agent,"Confirmed original CI failure at run 40506542936 and current ENOENT-only stat catch. Production killGroup currently suppresses every enumeration and signal error, so the fix must also expose unrelated cleanup failures in bounded receipts. Plan shared disappearance classification and deterministic I/O schedules, retaining the real detached-descendant deadline test. Current main has newer successful CI runs; this is still an unresolved intermittent race."
  "2026-10-28T19:34:29.252Z",codex-agent,"Deterministic regressions pass 13/13. Disposable source-only reverts: removing ESRCH classification fails 5/13 tests including enumeration, stat, group and PID boundaries; suppressing unrelated cleanup failures fails 1/13; skipping the PID fallback fails 8/13. Restored source passes 13/13. Process fixtures distinguish live children and zombies, preserve sibling/root cleanup after EACCES/EPERM/EIO, and cover bounded host cleanup/spawn refusals. Typecheck, test typecheck, lint, docstrings and zero duplication pass. Test launchers now cap workers at two without changing thresholds."
  "2026-10-28T19:36:02.221Z",codex-agent,"Pinned linked runner passed node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/closeout-process.test.ts test/closeout.test.ts: 35 tests, 35 pass, 0 fail/cancelled/skipped. Includes the real detached linked-command descendant deadline regression. The process and plain-tracker fixtures need no Git repository. Full npm/Bun release gates will run in PR CI at the final committed head."
